{{also|capulet}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Surname of the heroine Juliet's family in Shakespeare's ''Romeo and Juliet'', from the {{der|en|it|Capuleti}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|figuratively}} A member or citizen of the family, party, or country of the wife in a [[Romeo and Juliet couple]].

